# Never commit patient-level data. example_data.csv is synthetic and is tracked
# deliberately; everything else that looks like study data stays out.
#
# This includes the de-identified release copy. De-identified is not the same as
# public: that copy exists to answer individual data requests after institutional
# approval, and the paper states the data are not publicly available.
